Problem Statement:

Develop a water depot network system

using a graph (adjacency list) and a min-priority queue.

Water depot, road junctions and repair locations are stored as vertices,

roads between them are stored as edges with non-negative distances (km),

and Dijkstra's algorithm finds the least-cost route from the water depot to a selected repair location.

It supports add location, add road, display,

shortest route with total distance,

and changing the source vertex to recalculate the shortest distances.
